{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "28068440806094162", "organization": {"id": "1256402811057992", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "28068440806094162"}]}, "id": "1553011716471341"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "5475196772529862"}]}, "id": "5584880398238920"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "4787570687942058"}]}, "id": "3164311023841358"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "1838135369637490"}]}, "id": "467980170373254"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "28068440806094162", "release_date": 1787243280, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "28242512798686961"}, "id": "1014766844522811"}]}}, "binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "28068440806094162", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28242512798686961"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "id": "28242512798686961", "version": "1.9.0", "version_code": 25, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1785243070, "id": "28068440862760823", "is_initial_release": true, "name_with_fallback": "v1", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 1, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "28068440832760826"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "28068440806094162"}, "id": "28068440832760826", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": true, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "28068440806094162", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1921239611865139"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2508593572937663", "locale": "pt_BR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VR Vision Kiosk Player", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# V\u00eddeos imersivos profissionais no Meta Quest\n\nO **VR Vision Kiosk Player** transforma o Meta Quest em uma esta\u00e7\u00e3o confi\u00e1vel para v\u00eddeos 180\u00b0 e 360\u00b0, criada para eventos, exposi\u00e7\u00f5es, treinamentos, museus, showrooms e experi\u00eancias de marca.\n\n## Fluxo em modo quiosque\n\n- Tela de espera personalizada, pronta para o pr\u00f3ximo participante\n- In\u00edcio pelo bot\u00e3o do controle, Volume + ou gesto de positivo\n- Retorno autom\u00e1tico \u00e0 tela inicial ap\u00f3s cada sess\u00e3o\n- Sele\u00e7\u00e3o de um \u00fanico v\u00eddeo ativo no headset, sem playlist\n- Configura\u00e7\u00f5es persistentes de idioma, ID do evento, ID do headset e cobertura do trip\u00e9\n- Interface em ingl\u00eas e portugu\u00eas do Brasil\n- Diagn\u00f3stico e progresso no controle para a equipe do evento\n\n## Proje\u00e7\u00e3o e nome do arquivo\n\nA proje\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 detectada pelo nome:\n\n- Adicione **`_360`** para v\u00eddeo 360\u00b0, por exemplo `casa-02_360.mp4`\n- Adicione **`_180`** para v\u00eddeo 180\u00b0\n- Use `_SBS`, `_LR` ou `_3DH` para est\u00e9reo lado a lado\n- Use `_TB`, `_3DV` ou `_OverUnder` para est\u00e9reo superior e inferior\n- Sem marcador est\u00e9reo, o v\u00eddeo \u00e9 reproduzido em modo monosc\u00f3pico\n\n## Adicione seu v\u00eddeo\n\nCopie um arquivo compat\u00edvel para:\n\n`/sdcard/Android/data/com.vrvision.kisokplayervr/files/Videos/`\n\nAbra as Configura\u00e7\u00f5es pelo menu do controle esquerdo e escolha o v\u00eddeo que dever\u00e1 ser reproduzido.\n\n*O v\u00eddeo n\u00e3o est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo. A compatibilidade depende do codec e da resolu\u00e7\u00e3o aceitos pelo Meta Quest.*", "short_description": "Player profissional de v\u00eddeos 180\u00b0 e 360\u00b0 para Meta Quest, criado para eventos, exposi\u00e7\u00f5es, treinamentos e experi\u00eancias em modo quiosque."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Meta-icone-novo.png", "id": "37691423030471092", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON_BACKGROUND", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310646_37691423070471088_5349673270830492937_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7sKp2IlGVggQ7kNvwFKjXJF&_nc_oc=AdrQydhYeQQ4JT7rj-RKagoxYSHrutioedcIvKvB9oX-GO-0ZzKT_osMb50Ad7f80i0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH-voQftHN4JK9bfg84l4n3AdltDlCC9t_6R71lOEiTdQ&oe=6A95C315"}, {"file_name": "Kiosk - Hero Cover _ - 3000 x 900px (32-Bit PNG).png", "id": "4663594827202928", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499293825_4663594830536261_7121342605201416589_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A3PufEel1c8Q7kNvwHsdj6w&_nc_oc=AdptfS3tP6JMcLraHjXZvM2JZdfqx3EQ5xFBTicB2eVYUbuuVa7703xUerdUJNHg8jM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFRfpCethnH4DrtUAlsvr2wW0DLWr24Stgn9rjLtoq1oQ&oe=6A95D693"}, {"file_name": "icone-lioskvr.png", "id": "2401142277046021", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312454_2401142280379354_1564528515856864418_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SCgDqSdY1k0Q7kNvwFYd5PM&_nc_oc=AdrLja0qXe7dj6p4D6V2fVJQS4Y9NTdhH_DmRqS4kWoiQ2jSo8bioGazI0nmIH3lxx0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFuA7pyDGljIPhGvMrwtlnA07HhVzYgu_68Y1Cnc8kIoA&oe=6A95D0CF"}, {"file_name": "Kiosk - cover Meta MQDH (1008\u00a0\u00d7\u00a01440\u00a0px).png", "id"